  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application would result in the loss of a dwellinghouse for which there is an identified need and in the absence of a legal agreement, the development fails to secure a nomination agreement agreed with the Council to maximise the utilisation for local residents, and to ensure against the importation of need from outside the Borough, and any necessary monitoring fees and planning services fees. The development would therefore be contrary to adopted Local Plan policies SC1, SC8 and IMP3",
    "Reason : 2 - The application fails to demonstrate how the proposal would avoid adverse impacts on the living of neighbouring residents due to the increased comings and goings and high level of care for residents which lead to a greater noise and disturbance than the single family dwelling presently there. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 and EQ5",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal by virtue of its design fails to respond to the character and context of the surrounding area, harming the character of the area and the host property. The proposal is therefore contrary to the intentions of the National Planning Policy Framework which seeks to promote high quality design, London Plan policies D3, D4 and Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC4",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposal fails to demonstrate that it would not result in increased parking stress or prejudice highway safety and does not make adequate arrangements for cycle parking contrary to London Plan policies T5 and T6 and Local Plan policy EC2."
  ],
